#subtitle: Setting the party's ideological direction.

= Questions of Ideology

The <span style="color: #BD7E3B;">ASL</span> has traditionally held a narrow and specific ideological view. If we are to expand, perhaps we should reform our platform. What should be our primary ideological guidance for now?

[? if ideology != 0 : We have previously chosen a [+ ideology +] ideology. Changing it will likely have drawbacks. ?]

- @class_struggle: Perhaps the struggle against moral decadence requires a more.. hands-on approach. Do we really have something to learn from "Hatchet Granny"?
- @centrist: Our standard base of rural Protestants, focused only on the goal of restricting <span style="color: #964B00;">alcohol</span>, remains the clearest way to achieve our goals.
- @labor: The urban section of America suffers from alcoholism the worst. We should try to make inroads among the working class, and even <span style="color: #90D5FF;">immi</span><span style="color: #185E3F;">grants</span>.
- @reform: Following the <span style="color: #D3D3D3;">WCTU</span>, we should work for broader reform of the American system, and shift more attention to non-temperance issues.
- @socpat: Pursue the fusion of <span style='color: #c00000;'>socialism</span> and patriotism.
- @easy_discard

@class_struggle
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "left") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "left"; left_strength += 8; communist_coalition += 1; left_dissent -= 5; reformist_dissent += 5; z_relation -= 3; dvp_relation -= 5; ddp_relation -= 3; lvp_relation -= 3; ddp_cohesion -= 0.5; nationalization_support += 1; kpd_relation += 3; ddp_right += 1; dvp_right += 1.5; lvp_right += 1

The extremely minor radical wing of our party seeks inspiration from Southern mob violence and the escapades of Carrie Nation to physically intimidate saloons. Naturally, they are viewed as insane by most of our organisation.

@centrist
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "centrist") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "centrist"; center_strength += 8; center_dissent -= 10; left_dissent -= 5; reformist_dissent -= 5

The centre of our party represents the standard grouping we have been known for. They are the most bipartisan, and have no major goals besides the restriction of alcohol.

@labor
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "labor") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "labor"; labor_strength += 8; center_dissent += 5; wtb_support += 1; labor_dissent -= 5; kpd_relation -= 3

Our labor wing criticises the reluctance of our organisation to expand into the urban working class. Empowering them could greatly improve our standing. 

@reform
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "reformist") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "reformist"; reformist_strength += 8; democratization += 1; reformist_dissent -= 5; left_dissent += 5; z_relation += 5; dvp_relation += 5; ddp_relation += 5; lvp_relation += 5; kpd_relation -= 8; moderate_plan_support += 1; dvp_left += 1; ddp_left += 0.5; ddp_cohesion += 0.5; lvp_left += 1

The reformist wing sees the <span style="color: #BD7E3B;">Anti-Saloon League</span> as a modern and <span style="color: #FF0000;">dynamic</span> prototype, fit to evolve into a broader mass movement. They have even entertained the idea of turning the <span style="color: #BD7E3B;">League</span> into an independent political party of its own.

@socpat
view-if: social_patriot
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "socpat") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "socpat"; social_patriot_strength += 10; left_dissent += 10; center_dissent += 10; reformist_dissent += 5; z_relation += 6; dvp_relation += 6; ddp_relation += 6; lvp_relation += 6; kpd_relation -= 15; dvp_left += 1; ddp_left += 0.5; ddp_cohesion += 0.5; lvp_left += 1

The social patriot wing of the party, widely regarded as Schleicher's puppets, is the most supportive of the <span style='color: #c00000;'>**SPD**</span> and ADGB adopting a more nationalist stance.

@changed
on-arrival: left_dissent += 5; center_dissent += 5; labor_dissent += 5; reformist_dissent += 5

We have changed ideologies. Many in the party feel unmoored.
